- id: crypt
  name: Crypt
  kind: ambient
  volume: 0.7
  duration_ms: 24000
  loop: true
  blurb: >
    Below the castle. A heartbeat at 48 bpm, a tritone drone underneath, and
    whispers just past intelligibility. The lights barely admit anything is
    there — near-darkness is the effect.
  base: {towerL: chill, towerR: chill, door: blood}
  zones:
    door: {center: ember}
    towerR: {phase: 1.1}
  # The towers rest on a cold near-dark instead of true black: between
  # whispers they were dead pixels for seconds at a time. `chill` held this
  # low is a held breath — and being cold, it separates the towers (voices)
  # from the door (heart) even at rest.
  levels: {towerL: 0.35, towerR: 0.35}
  # Nothing in this scene is lit by the clock — every zone is driven by one
  # sound, and each sound owns a colour:
  #   red    = the heart      (door, both thumps of the lub-dub, snapping)
  #   green  = the voices     (towers, one flicker per whispered word,
  #                            alternating, so the voices move around you)
  #   violet = the bell       (everything blooms and falls slow)
  # The heart also throbs faintly through the towers, so the whole crypt
  # breathes with the door as the epicentre.
  #
  # The eyes are held at level 0.18 on purpose. At full brightness they are
  # a red floodlight tied to nothing in the audio, and they bury the
  # heartbeat in the same colour — the reason this scene read as flat. Kept
  # under the pulses, they are a presence you notice rather than a lamp.
  pulse:
    - {synth: heartbeat, zone: door, intensity: 0.85, decay: 0.82,
       color: [1.0, 0.03, 0.01, 0.0], pixels: center}
    - {synth: heartbeat, zones: [towerL, towerR], intensity: 0.10,
       decay: 0.88, color: [1.0, 0.05, 0.02, 0.0]}
    - {synth: whispers, zones: [towerL, towerR], alternate: true,
       intensity: 0.34, decay: 0.94, color: [0.24, 1.0, 0.38, 0.0],
       pixels: scatter}
    - {synth: toll, intensity: 0.5, decay: 0.972,
       color: [0.66, 0.08, 1.0, 0.06]}
  score:
    - {t: 0.0,  synth: drone,     dur: 24.0, gain: 0.9}
    - {t: 0.0,  synth: heartbeat, dur: 24.0, gain: 1.0}
    - {t: 2.0,  synth: whispers,  dur: 20.5, gain: 0.55}
    - {t: 14.0, synth: toll, gain: 0.3}
  cues:
    - {t: 3000,  op: set, zone: towerL, effect: eyes, level: 0.18, note: "something watches"}
    - {t: 12000, op: set, zone: towerL, effect: chill, level: 0.35, note: "eyes close"}
    - {t: 12600, op: set, zone: towerR, effect: eyes, level: 0.18, note: "…it moved"}
    - {t: 20000, op: set, zone: towerR, effect: chill, level: 0.35, note: "gone"}

